{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07453","headline":"初闻贬谪续喜量移登干越亭赠郑校书 · 刘长卿","name":"初闻贬谪续喜量移登干越亭赠郑校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青青草色满江洲，万里伤心水自流。\n越鸟岂知南国远，江花独向北人愁。\n生涯已逐沧浪去，冤气初逢涣汗收。\n何事还邀迁客醉，春风日夜待归舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}